1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,560
I'm freezing.

2
00:00:06,040 --> 00:00:07,960
Death adding a scarf to my ensemble tomorrow.

3
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:10,880
Evenings have been pretty nippy lately, haven't they?

4
00:00:17,440 --> 00:00:18,480
Um, hey.

5
00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:22,400
Uh, yourself.

6
00:00:27,860 --> 00:00:28,620
