7
00:00:28,620 --> 00:00:31,220
If you think I'm going to let you steal my boyfriend, think again.

8
00:00:31,400 --> 00:00:33,140
I just said hey and now I'm a boyfriend.

9
00:00:33,280 --> 00:00:35,640
You do much weirder stuff than say hey and you know it.

10
00:00:35,780 --> 00:00:37,540
I've seen how dodgy-feely you do get.

11
00:00:37,560 --> 00:00:38,660
Oh, sorry about that.

12
00:00:39,340 --> 00:00:41,000
I mean, we are closer.

13
00:00:41,280 --> 00:00:43,040
Way more than we used to be, but that's it.

14
00:00:43,280 --> 00:00:44,280
All we are is friends.

15
00:00:44,760 --> 00:00:47,420
I started out as Miyamoto's friend, too, you know.

16
00:00:47,980 --> 00:00:50,480
So exactly how close do you intend to get to him?

17
00:00:50,820 --> 00:00:52,040
You're that threatened by me?

18
00:00:52,380 --> 00:00:53,560
Shindo's ten times worse.

19
00:00:53,700 --> 00:00:54,060
No!

20
00:00:54,940 --> 00:00:56,800
I didn't realize.

21
00:00:56,800 --> 00:00:59,300
Do you love Shindo more than me?

22
00:00:59,400 --> 00:01:00,580
Absolutely not!

23
00:01:01,040 --> 00:01:02,360
Then what did you mean?

24
00:01:02,500 --> 00:01:04,080
What makes Shindo such a threat to me?

25
00:01:04,140 --> 00:01:07,640
Well, threat might be too strong of a word,

26
00:01:07,780 --> 00:01:09,720
but I have seen him go over to Miyamura's place

27
00:01:09,720 --> 00:01:11,360
to pick up a change of clothes in the past.

28
00:01:11,360 --> 00:01:15,040
Look, he invites himself, okay?

29
00:01:15,180 --> 00:01:15,960
Not my fault.

30
00:01:17,760 --> 00:01:18,200
Hmm.

31
00:01:21,460 --> 00:01:23,000
A wild Shindo appears!

32
00:01:23,880 --> 00:01:26,160
You guys having a block party over here or what?

33
00:01:26,280 --> 00:01:26,940
Mind if I join?

34
00:01:27,180 --> 00:01:27,860
Looks like fun.

35
00:01:29,160 --> 00:01:30,100
Random question.

36
00:01:30,600 --> 00:01:32,280
But are you and Chika fairly close?

37
00:01:32,980 --> 00:01:36,080
Eh, studying for exams has been eating up all her time,

38
00:01:36,180 --> 00:01:37,540
so not lately, no.

39
00:01:37,540 --> 00:01:40,980
I've spent plenty of sleepless nights at Miyamura's, though,

40
00:01:41,060 --> 00:01:42,620
so don't feel too bad for me.

41
00:01:43,820 --> 00:01:45,320
You hungry?

42
00:01:45,700 --> 00:01:46,620
Let's grab a burger.

43
00:01:47,500 --> 00:01:49,680
Yeah, you're always trying to have a cow anyway,

44
00:01:49,840 --> 00:01:51,000
so why not eat one instead?

45
00:01:51,300 --> 00:01:52,400
I'm so lost right now,

46
00:01:52,540 --> 00:01:54,760
but a burger actually does sound good.

47
00:01:54,980 --> 00:01:56,420
Ooh, did that coupon expire yet?

48
00:01:56,800 --> 00:01:57,720
Uh, yeah, it did.

49
00:01:59,500 --> 00:02:01,820
Miyamura, let's make something clear.

50
00:02:02,680 --> 00:02:03,080
Okay?

51
00:02:03,620 --> 00:02:05,160
Girls are the least of my concerns.

52
00:02:05,160 --> 00:02:07,060
Guys, on the other hand,

53
00:02:07,280 --> 00:02:09,780
I see them taking you so easily,

54
00:02:09,960 --> 00:02:11,060
and I just can't.

55
00:02:12,020 --> 00:02:13,700
You see them taking me how?

56
00:02:14,140 --> 00:02:15,420
Promise me one thing.

57
00:02:15,600 --> 00:02:16,840
If you fall for someone else,

58
00:02:16,880 --> 00:02:17,820
it better be a girl.

59
00:02:18,380 --> 00:02:19,500
Can you do that for me?

60
00:02:21,160 --> 00:02:21,600
Sure.

61
00:02:21,920 --> 00:02:22,700
Consider it done.

62
00:02:23,700 --> 00:02:25,700
So you all need to stay out of my bubble.

63
00:02:26,020 --> 00:02:26,800
From now on,

64
00:02:27,060 --> 00:02:28,460
I need you to keep your distance.

65
00:02:29,100 --> 00:02:30,640
What about when you gotta go,

66
00:02:30,840 --> 00:02:32,400
like, to the toilet?

67
00:02:32,400 --> 00:02:34,280
I won't go in public!

68
00:02:34,560 --> 00:02:35,200
I'll hold it!

69
00:02:35,360 --> 00:02:36,820
The things you do for love,

70
00:02:37,040 --> 00:02:37,800
have fun with that.

71
00:02:38,780 --> 00:02:41,300
No, I'm your host.

72
00:02:41,800 --> 00:02:42,700
All right.

73
00:02:42,780 --> 00:02:43,180
You can just consider it as stupid.

74
00:02:43,180 --> 00:03:13,160
We'll be right back.

75
00:03:13,180 --> 00:03:43,160
We'll be right back.

76
00:03:43,180 --> 00:04:13,160
We'll be right back.

77
00:04:13,160 --> 00:04:43,140
We'll be right back.

78
