179
00:09:43,080 --> 00:09:44,320
Ah, good idea.

180
00:09:45,240 --> 00:09:48,040
Try and tell her in person, so you can watch the tantrum she throws.

181
00:09:48,240 --> 00:09:49,980
Hey, she's more mature than that.

182
00:09:50,940 --> 00:09:52,300
Sure hope she comes tomorrow.

183
00:09:52,740 --> 00:09:53,060
Yeah.

184
00:09:55,280 --> 00:09:56,660
