194
00:10:30,100 --> 00:10:31,540
It's okay to want things.

195
00:10:31,540 --> 00:10:32,840
You shouldn't feel embarrassed.

196
00:10:33,180 --> 00:10:37,480
What's not okay is wallowing in self-pity because you keep letting the things you want pass you by.

197
00:10:38,940 --> 00:10:41,620
Don't let it go if you're just going to complain about it afterward.

198
00:10:42,160 --> 00:10:45,320
Why can't I have a pretty new hair clip that's like the kind she has?

199
00:10:45,460 --> 00:10:48,600
Because when I asked you in the store, you told me you were fine without one.

200
00:10:58,440 --> 00:10:58,880
Here.

201
00:10:59,440 --> 00:11:00,060
Take it.

202
00:11:01,540 --> 00:11:04,900
